TI  - Serological and histological evaluation of species-specific immunocontraceptive vaccine antigens based on zona pellucida 3 in the small Indian mongoose (Herpestes auropunctatus).
AU  - Kuninaga, Naotoshi
AU  - Asano, Makoto
AU  - Matsuyama, Ryota
AU  - Minemoto, Takahiro
AU  - Mori, Takayuki
AU  - Suzuki, Masatsugu
