TI  - Acupuncture modulates extracellular vesicle-miRNA-HMOX1 axis to inhibit ferroptosis in polycystic ovary syndrome: integrating machine learning, in vitro and in vivo studies.
AU  - Wu, Xiaoling
AU  - Li, Yuanyin
AU  - Wang, Naxin
