TI  - Cuproptosis-related Gene SLC31A1 Correlates with M2 Macrophage Infiltration and Serves as a Potential Therapeutic Target in Glioma: A Comprehensive Analysis of 1573 Samples from TCGA and CGGA Databases.
AU  - Hu, Man
