TI  - Neuroprotective Effects of lncRNA EPB41L4A-AS1 Against Ischemic Stroke Injury Through Regulating Microglial State Transition and Ferroptosis via miR-214-3p/GPX4 Axis.
AU  - Guo, Ying
AU  - Yi, Jinyuan
AU  - Fang, Haitao
AU  - Zhang, Yu
AU  - Zhang, Haixiao
