TI  - Vagus nerve stimulation alleviates anxiety by inhibiting ferroptosis-related neuronal damage through alpha7nAChR.
AU  - Sun, Jixiang
AU  - Lyu, Yanmin
AU  - Huang, Mengying
AU  - Du, Chunxiao
AU  - Chen, Junrui
